うとしているか、シチュエーションは何でも構いません。\n・沢山の世界を超えて再会を繰り返し、色んな経験をしたお2人ですので、そういう関係性が表す様に、賑やかで楽しい雰囲気の一枚をお願い致します。\n・「夏、太陽と月、夜明け・夕焼け、地平線、民族風」のモチーフをどちらでもご自由に使って大丈夫です。\n・ポーズや構図は他は何でも構いませんので、お気軽に描いてください！\n\n依頼内容に何か難しい点か問題点があれば、お気になさらずこの依頼をキャンセルしてください。ご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/221di69krep1", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 484299, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "たかむら", "screen_name": "ramuneman", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1609531865073090563/CeMbpr9e.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/543975420/1767868862/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 1705449, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "横 yoko", "screen_name": "Bh1h1J", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1637507099059187712/CdDdHJOG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1432670350861426694/1761484627/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 1976305, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "むぎばたけ", "screen_name": "MUGI062", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1965067433733185536/TB9LvAQz.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1384097537322225670/1771172514/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_crea